// The return and warranty policy of Calloway Cycles (policy.md).
Document "policy.md"

Fact shop Identified by Calloway
Fact customer
Fact item
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Fact proof Identified by Receipt, NoReceipt
Param return-window : Duration = 30
Param warranty : Duration = 365

// The sale: who bought what, for how much, and whether as final sale
Fact bought Identified by customer * item
Function price Identified by item * usd
Fact final-sale Identified by item
Act sell Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item, usd
  Holds when True
  Creates bought(), price()

// 1. Returns: thirty days; a refund with the receipt, store credit without; not final sale
Fact returnable Identified by customer * item
  Default bought-within-thirty-days Holds when bought() && Not(Held(bought()) For return-window)
  Exception sold-as-final-sale Overrides bought-within-thirty-days Rejects when final-sale()
Fact store-credit Identified by customer * item
Act return Actor customer Related to item, proof
  Holds when True
  Valid when returnable()
  Creates refund-due() When proof == Receipt, store-credit() When proof == NoReceipt
  Terminates bought()

// 2. Warranty: a defect within the year is repaired or replaced within thirty days
Fact defective Identified by item
Fact covered Identified by item
Event defect-found Related to item
  Creates defective(), covered() When (Exists customer: bought() && Not(Held(bought()) For warranty))
Act bring-in Actor customer Related to item
  Holds when True
  Valid when bought() && covered()
  Creates repair-due()
Duty repair-due Holder shop Claimant customer Related to item
  Due within 30
  Terminated by repair, replace
Act repair Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item
  Valid when Not(Violated(repair-due()))
  Terminates defective()
Act replace Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item
  Valid when Not(Violated(repair-due()))
  Terminates defective()

// 3. Refunds: due on a return with the receipt, or when the repair is overdue; paid in ten days
Duty refund-due Holder shop Claimant customer Related to item
  Holds when Violated(repair-due())
  Due within 10
  Terminated by refund
Act refund Actor shop Recipient customer Related to item, usd
  Valid when price()
  Terminates repair-due()

Clause 1.1 Approved "17875da241220e1b77c2485f82664251cd64f527f3e2cb41af7227d54a59247c"
  Norm "A customer may return an item to Calloway Cycles within thirty days after buying it." => sell, return
Clause 1.2 Approved "f3972859bc4a1472b587c2d13699eb19376951deac8e0858a97f6d9c36265e58"
  Norm "A customer who returns an item with its receipt receives a refund of the price paid." => return, refund-due, refund
  Norm " A customer who returns an item without its receipt receives store credit for the price instead." => return
Clause 1.3 Approved "b8ace2674fd43bdd8123cd163dc7cf9b874394f9d9f3c6996611ae0dbd468512"
  Norm "An item sold as final sale cannot be returned." => return
Clause 2.1 Approved "cb699c8b52587250f79e61f60ccb7fe6906df5fdd78a551aa96d5eea3dd5ac69"
  Norm "If an item proves defective within one year after it was bought, the shop repairs or replaces it once the customer brings it in." => bring-in, repair-due, repair, replace
Clause 2.2 Approved "48d885b4e598691e4d06ae73ad072b3079dc2cc16312ae076dbb482b28b011b6"
  Norm "If the shop has not repaired or replaced the item within thirty days after the customer brought it in, the shop refunds the price paid." => repair, replace, refund-due, refund
Clause 3.1 Approved "49a52ccf11a50814abe490ea1f39195ddd9cb7d48b34716b0c3088b7a3061eeb"
  Norm "The shop pays a refund within ten days after it becomes due." => refund-due, refund
.
